::notes

This is a flexible one-person starting point: only eggs and potatoes are essential. Bacon, onion, cheese and paprika are the author’s usual additions; mushrooms and peppers are occasional additions. Adjust to preference.
The source sets the bacon aside and never specifies when to return it or an alternative frying fat if omitted.
# The author prefers beating the eggs in a bowl first.

::story

